<resources>
    <string name="gh_title">Ghamza</string>
    <string name="gh_tagline">Phones down. Eyes open.</string>
    <string name="gh_subtitle">3–12 players · One secret Winker</string>
    <string name="gh_open">Enter the circle</string>
    <string name="gh_rules">Each round, one random player is the Winker; the same person may be chosen again. Reveal your own role privately, then everyone presses Ready. Winks happen in person. Guests honestly confirm “I was winked at”; each report uses one life. At zero lives they are out of this round, but stay in the room. When one guest remains, they guess the Winker. A correct guess eliminates the Winker; an incorrect guess eliminates the guesser. No points or cumulative winner. Play 1, 3, or 5 rounds with 1, 2, or 3 lives. The host starts the next round: everyone returns with full lives and new random roles.</string>
